{
  "case_id": "CHIP-CLIENT-DENY-1.21.1",
  "title": "筹码商店·物品栏满拒绝（哨兵 772）：屏内填满 36 格后点确认 ⇒ deny=2 红闪、不扣款不重抽",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "chip-shop"
  },
  "on_fail": "continue",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "筹码商店·客户端确认时物品栏满 ⇒ DENY_INVENTORY_FULL(2) 红闪、不扣款、不重抽（哨兵 772）。判据正本 = 计划表 §4 拒绝码 2 + 校验序（余额 → 找空位 → 扣款 → 写物品栏）+ §6。\n\n⚠️ 关键设计约束（实测教训）：**不能**「先填满物品栏再开屏」—— ChipShopOpener.open 自己就会以 inventory_full 拒绝开店，屏根本不会出现；而「菜单已开 + 物品栏满」也无法用 /astralshop 的守卫命令造（守卫开店同样被拒）。\n⇒ 必须由**客户端在屏内**发命令填满物品栏：本场景 step8 用 csCmd（mc.player.connection.sendCommand，GUI 开着时唯一可用的命令通道）发 `astralshop cinv CHIPD fill`，再 step20 选格、step40 点确认。\n\n链路：cprice CD 0 归一化 → bal CD 772 武装 → copenkeep 开屏（gate=772）⇒ step8 填满 36 格（服务端落 AP_CHIPD_CINV:inv=36/36）⇒ step40 点确认 ⇒ 服务端 handleBuy 在「找空位」这一步失败 ⇒ 不扣款、不重抽、发 ChipShopDenyPayload(2) ⇒ 客户端 deny=2 + 红闪 30t ⇒ step110 自关屏。\n\n判据：客户端 after_confirm 读数 deny=2 + 红闪；服务端事后读数余额仍 772、purchased 仍 0、候选与次数未变（offers/last/refreshes/anchor/price 全部同开屏前）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode creative",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop curioreset CD",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop creset CD",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop cprice CD 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop bal CD 772",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop copenkeep CD",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 14000
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop cstate CD",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "kubejs_client",
